answer_additional_questions: outputSchema  parameters: -status. +status (or, when the quote names the insurer and its NAIC number but not its status, the risk state's regulator license record cited with the quote's words). It decides the quote's paper ahead of its route's. -this quote explicitly identifies both; +both are evidenced;
get_quote_status: outputSchema  parameters: -status. +status (or, when the quote names the insurer and its NAIC number but not its status, the risk state's regulator license record cited with the quote's words). It decides the quote's paper ahead of its route's. -this quote explicitly identifies both; +both are evidenced;
