assess_broken_app: description  -after the live re-check passes. +up front.
check_live_app: description  -after the re-check passes. +up front.
get_check_result: description  -after the re-check passes); +up front);

check_server: outputSchema  parameters: -newer_protocol; +newer_protocol, unsupported_version (rejects the protocol version the client asks for);
lookup_server: outputSchema  parameters: -newer_protocol; +newer_protocol, unsupported_version (rejects the protocol version the client asks for);
