estimate_landed_cost: description  -Figures are estimates +Rough figures only: fee and shipping tables currently cover US, GB, DE and FR (other countries return no routes), come -published fee tables, not quotes; +third-party comparison guides (mid-2026) and exclude duties. Not a quote;
explain_product: description  +shipping (whether it is only sold at shops that ship within Japan, so a shipping-forwarding service is needed from abroad; costs are not calculated),
resolve_listing: description  +shipping (whether a shipping-forwarding service is needed from abroad; set platform for a precise answer),
